 in recent commits (W2â€“W5). *(Anchor: memory `aurora-awareness-revamp.md`, `aurora-revamp-plan.md`; `docs/AURORA_REVAMP_PLAN.md`)*\n\nOne caveat worth flagging: these claims are grounded in the project's own docs (`CLAUDE.md`, the plan, and memory), not in a fresh read of the running code. If you want, I can verify any specific claim â€” e.g. confirm the actual schedule times or that the publisher still targets `aurora-library` â€” against the live source."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4417,"cache_read_input_tokens":28002,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":4417,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c73c6bb6-1c01-47ed-85ae-73cfeeeca3de","uuid":"41e7e925-d0b7-42de-883a-9f801b14b812","request_id":"req_011Cc1equSGnpuRBh1q24H3Y"}
